{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro]\n[00:09.24] Heaven\n[00:16.96] (Purps on the beat)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:19.98] Got to go through hell to get to heaven\n[00:24.24] Got to learn through life to get the lesson\n[00:28.82] Feelin' like a lil' kid, a adolescent\n[00:31.50] Feelin' like the answer's out of my reach\n[00:33.80] Praying out to God, please help me, please help—\n[Chorus]\n[00:36.26] Oh-oh-oh-oh (Help me, help me, dear Lord, please help me)\n[00:37.48] Oh-oh-oh-oh (Help me, help me, dear Lord, please help me)\n[00:40.34] Oh-oh-oh-oh (Lord, help me, help me, dear Lord, please help me)\n[00:55.68] Oh-oh-oh-oh (Help me out)\n[Verse 2]\n[00:57.20] Stuck in the same place, yeah, no space like a crawl space, yeah\n[01:01.50] No love, all hatred, can't live in a place like that\n[01:06.20] Ooh, I admit, never felt no pain like this\n[01:10.38] Prolly 'cause all the pills I did, pills I did, oh\n[01:14.18] Tryna fight the demons, think I'm movin' forward\n[01:16.50] But I'm in the same place, yeah-yeah\n[01:18.80] Fast forward, in a black Porsche, tryna figure how to maintain, yeah-yeah\n[01:23.28] Heart don't feel the same no more\n[01:25.76] Had enough love games, lil' ho\n[01:28.08] Don't think I can love the same anymore\n[Bridge]\n[01:30.54] Time to move on, time to move on\n[01:31.78] Time to move on, time to move on\n[01:39.82] Time to move on, time to move on\n[01:40.98] Time to move on, time to move on (Uh)\n[Verse 3]\n[01:50.76] Happiness ain't bankrolls, you the type to have me keep my heart closed\n[01:54.98] Tellin' me you wanna work out the same things that ain't work in the first place\n[02:00.08] Hard for me to keep my eyes open\n[02:02.30] Had me ballin' out my eyes, swollen\n[02:04.86] I've had enough, this isn't love, not even lust\n[02:08.22] I know what it really is, it's done\n[02:10.40] Honestly, ain't wanna be the one\n[02:12.74] To say it's over, but this shit is overdue\n[02:17.42] I know what it really is, it's done\n[02:19.84] I ain't wanna be the one to say it's over, but\n[02:22.12] Bitch, it's over\n[02:22.90] It's o-over, bitch, it's o-over\n[02:27.40] It's o-over, bitch, it's over (Hey)\n[02:37.04] Ain't no lullabies, just nightmares, just nightmares\n[02:51.20] Ain't no lullabies, just nightmares when you there\n[02:55.86] Ain't no lullabies, and if there's lullabies, they're full of lies that you care\n[Outro]\n[03:01.96] Bitch, it's over\n[03:04.36] It's o-over, bitch, it's o-over\n[03:11.76] It's o-over, bitch, it's over\n[03:17.68] Bitch, it's over, hey","words":[[9.12,9.2,"[Intro]"],[9.24,10.42,"Heaven"],[16.96,17.14,"(Purps"],[17.18,18.2,"on"],[19.34,19.56,"the"],[19.6,19.68,"beat)"],[19.72,19.86,"[Verse"],[19.88,19.94,"1]"],[19.98,20.14,"Got"],[20.22,20.24,"to"],[20.3,20.32,"go"],[20.36,20.74,"through"],[20.78,21.12,"hell"],[21.34,21.44,"to"],[21.52,21.62,"get"],[21.7,21.78,"to"],[21.92,22.2,"heaven"],[24.24,24.32,"Got"],[24.42,24.48,"to"],[24.6,24.86,"learn"],[24.98,25.28,"through"],[25.38,25.9,"life"],[25.98,26.02,"to"],[26.18,26.28,"get"],[26.32,26.38,"the"],[26.54,26.84,"lesson"],[28.82,29.2,"Feelin'"],[29.24,29.38,"like"],[29.46,29.46,"a"],[29.58,29.76,"lil'"],[29.96,30.58,"kid,"],[30.66,30.66,"a"],[30.84,31.46,"adolescent"],[31.5,31.86,"Feelin'"],[31.9,32.06,"like"],[32.1,32.18,"the"],[32.32,32.64,"answer's"],[32.76,32.86,"out"],[32.94,32.98,"of"],[33.06,33.3,"my"],[33.48,33.74,"reach"],[33.8,34.12,"Praying"],[34.26,34.36,"out"],[34.4,34.46,"to"],[34.6,34.88,"God,"],[34.96,35.32,"please"],[35.4,35.48,"help"],[35.52,35.56,"me,"],[35.6,35.84,"please"],[35.92,36.04,"help—"],[36.08,36.22,"[Chorus]"],[36.26,36.5,"Oh-oh-oh-oh"],[36.54,36.62,"(Help"],[36.66,36.68,"me,"],[36.72,36.78,"help"],[36.82,36.84,"me,"],[36.88,36.98,"dear"],[37.02,37.1,"Lord,"],[37.14,37.24,"please"],[37.28,37.34,"help"],[37.38,37.4,"me)"],[37.48,38.18,"Oh-oh-oh-oh"],[38.22,38.28,"(Help"],[38.46,38.56,"me,"],[39.28,39.4,"help"],[39.46,39.48,"me,"],[39.52,39.62,"dear"],[39.76,39.94,"Lord,"],[39.98,40.